<title>UK: TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF HENMAN V HAARHUIS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF HENMAN V HAARHUIS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics of the third-round</p>
<p>match between Briton Tim Henman and Paul Haarhuis of the</p>
<p>Netherlands at Wimbledon on Sunday:</p>
<p>Henman won 6-7 (7-9) 6-3 6-2 4-6 14-12</p>
<p>Time: 3 hours 54 minutes</p>
<p>				    HENMAN	     HAARHUIS</p>
<p>Aces				   13		   9 </p>
<p>Double faults			14		  18</p>
<p>Percentage first serves	  58		  64</p>
<p>Unreturned serves		  77		  72</p>
<p>Forehand winners		   12		  11</p>
<p>Backhand winners		   11		   9</p>
<p>Volley winners		     37		  34</p>
<p>Passing winners		    10		   6</p>
<p>Return winners		     10		  10</p>
<p>Percentage returns in	    67		  57</p>
<p>Break points held		   5		  15</p>
<p>Break points won		    7		   3</p>
</text>
